---
import '@fontsource-variable/inter';
import HeroFlow from '../components/HeroFlow.astro';

const coffee = 'mailto:sam@solomon.io?subject=Let%E2%80%99s%20get%20coffee';
const project = 'mailto:sam@solomon.io?subject=A%20project%20for%20Sam';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><title>Sam-as-a-Service — The Sam Solomon Company of Atlanta</title><meta name="description" content="Design leadership and technology for sales teams. One experienced collaborator, based in Atlanta."/><link rel="preload" href="/fonts/GeistSerif-Regular.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin/></head><body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<div class="announcement"><a href="#company">Introducing The Sam Solomon Company of Atlanta <span>Meet the company →</span></a></div>
<header><div class="nav-shell"><a class="brand" href="#" aria-label="Sam-as-a-Service home">Sam</a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#platform">Product</a><a href="#services">Solutions</a><a href="#resources">Resources</a><a href="#company">Company</a></nav><div class="nav-actions"><a href="#plans">Pricing</a><a class="pill outline" href={coffee}>Book a coffee</a><a class="pill" href={project}>Get in touch</a></div><details class="mobile-menu"><summary>Menu</summary><div><a href="#platform">Product</a><a href="#services">Solutions</a><a href="#resources">Resources</a><a href="#plans">Pricing</a><a href={coffee}>Book a coffee</a></div></details></div></header>
<main id="main"><section class="hero"><HeroFlow/><div class="hero-content"><h1>One person.<br/>Quite a few capabilities.</h1><p>Sam-as-a-Service brings design leadership and hands-on building to your team. From figuring out what comes next to making the thing actually work.</p><a class="pill" href={project}>Let’s talk</a></div></section>
<section class="proof wrap" aria-label="Capabilities"><p>Built around your team.<br class="mobile-only"/> Powered by <em>one human.</em></p><div class="proof-list"><span>Product strategy</span><span>Design leadership</span><span>Sales technology</span><span>Software development</span><span>Atlanta, Georgia</span></div></section>
<section id="services" class="section wrap"><h2>Pick your problem.<br/>Put Sam to work.</h2><div class="solutions"><article><h3>Design Leadership</h3><p>Turn an uncertain product direction into something your team can build.</p><div class="tags"><span>Product strategy</span><span>Design critique</span><span>Team guidance</span><span>Interface design</span></div><a href={project}>Explore design leadership <span>↗</span></a></article><article><h3>Sales Technology</h3><p>Make the tools fit the team.<br/>Give the busywork somewhere else to go.</p><div class="tags"><span>Internal tools</span><span>Workflows</span><span>Integrations</span><span>Automation</span></div><a href={project}>Discuss sales technology <span>↗</span></a></article><article><h3>A Second Brain</h3><p>A fresh perspective on the thing you’ve been staring at for too long.</p><div class="tags"><span>Advisory</span><span>Problem framing</span><span>Prototypes</span><span>Coffee</span></div><a href={coffee}>Start a conversation <span>↗</span></a></article></div></section>
<div class="statement wrap"><p>“You’ll work directly with the founder.<br/>Also the designer. Also the developer.”</p><span>Our exceptionally flat organizational structure.</span></div>
<section id="platform" class="section wrap"><h2>From the first question<br/>to the thing that ships.</h2><p class="section-description">A collaborator who can follow the work across disciplines.<br/>No need to bring the next department up to speed.</p><div class="feature-grid"><article><h3>Give the team a clear direction.<br/>Then help them get there.</h3><div class="placeholder"><span>Product strategy / project image</span><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="7" width="38" height="34" rx="2"/><path d="m6 33 11-11 9 9 6-6 11 12"/><circle cx="32" cy="17" r="3"/></svg></div><a href={project}>Explore design leadership ↗</a></article><article><h3>Build software around<br/>the way your sales team works.</h3><div class="placeholder"><span>Sales technology / product image</span><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="7" width="38" height="34" rx="2"/><path d="m6 33 11-11 9 9 6-6 11 12"/><circle cx="32" cy="17" r="3"/></svg></div><a href={project}>Discuss a build ↗</a></article><article><h3>Connect the pieces.<br/>Reduce the work between the work.</h3><div class="placeholder"><span>Workflow / integration image</span><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="7" width="38" height="34" rx="2"/><path d="m6 33 11-11 9 9 6-6 11 12"/><circle cx="32" cy="17" r="3"/></svg></div><a href={project}>Talk through your workflow ↗</a></article><article><h3>Get an outside perspective.<br/>Keep the conversation human.</h3><div class="placeholder"><span>Collaboration / photography</span><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="7" width="38" height="34" rx="2"/><path d="m6 33 11-11 9 9 6-6 11 12"/><circle cx="32" cy="17" r="3"/></svg></div><a href={coffee}>Book a coffee ↗</a></article></div></section>
<section id="plans" class="plans"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-intro"><h2>The right amount<br/><em>of Sam.</em></h2><p>Start with a conversation.<br/>Escalate to a working relationship.</p></div><div class="plan-grid"><article class="plan"><h3>Coffee</h3><p class="plan-price">On the house.</p><p>For old friends, new people and<br/>“we should catch up sometime.”</p><ul><li>A conversation with Sam</li><li>Ideas exchanged freely</li><li>No qualification call for the call</li></ul><a class="button secondary" href={coffee}>Book a coffee <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><small>Scheduling by email. Very human of us.</small></article><article class="plan professional"><div class="plan-title"><h3>Professional</h3><span>PROJECTS & ADVISORY</span></div><p class="plan-price">Let’s scope it.</p><p>For a real problem that could<br/>use another good brain.</p><ul><li>Design leadership</li><li>Custom sales team technology</li><li>Direct access to the entire company</li></ul><a class="button" href={project}>Discuss a project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><small>Scope and pricing agreed together.</small></article><article class="plan enterprise"><h3>Enterprise</h3><p class="plan-price">The whole Sam.</p><p>Deep organizational integration.<br/>An email address on your domain.</p><ul><li>Full-time commitment</li><li>Recurring recurring meetings</li><li>Benefits enrollment</li></ul><button class="button unavailable" disabled>Not accepting new customers</button><small>Not currently considering full-time roles.</small></article></div></div></section>

<section id="resources" class="section wrap"><div class="section-top"><h2>There’s more where<br/>this came from.</h2><a href="https://solomon.io/">Visit solomon.io ↗</a></div><div class="resource-grid"><a href="https://solomon.io/work/"><div class="placeholder"><span>Selected work / cover image</span></div><h3>Things I’ve helped bring into the world.</h3><p>Selected work →</p></a><a href="https://solomon.io/archive/"><div class="placeholder"><span>Writing / cover image</span></div><h3>Some thoughts, collected over the years.</h3><p>Essays, projects and talks →</p></a></div></section>
<section id="company" class="closing wrap"><h2>Start with a conversation.<br/>See what we can build.</h2><a class="pill" href={coffee}>Book a coffee</a><p>All inquiries reach senior management.</p></section></main>
<footer class="wrap"><div class="footer-top"><div><a class="brand" href="#">Sam</a><p>The Sam Solomon<br/>Company of Atlanta.</p></div><div><h3>Product</h3><a href="#platform">Sam-as-a-Service</a><a href="#services">Design leadership</a><a href="#services">Sales technology</a><a href="#plans">Pricing</a></div><div><h3>Resources</h3><a href="https://solomon.io/work/">Selected work</a><a href="https://solomon.io/archive/">Writing & talks</a></div><div><h3>Company</h3><a href="#company">About</a><a href={coffee}>Coffee</a><a href={project}>Contact</a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/samuelrsolomon/">LinkedIn ↗</a></div></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} The Sam Solomon Company of Atlanta</span><span>An organization of one.</span></div></footer></body></html>
